1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,980
As a child, washing my father's feet, my
heart would fill with so many blessings.

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:14,432
'May God bless you, may He go before you
on your path,

3
00:00:14,432 --> 00:00:19,800
may He raise you in wisdom and
understanding,' he would say.

4
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:27,420
Words from a pure heart were sown in me
like a seed, and they grew.

5
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:35,638
Many years passed. My father went home to
his Creator,

6
00:00:35,638 --> 00:00:38,920
but his blessing stayed with me.

7
00:00:40,225 --> 00:00:48,015
The peace, wisdom and honour he wished for
me came true in my life, one by one.

8
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:54,470
In every success of mine, I remember my
father's pure heart.

9
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:04,250
And when my father looks on my life from
heaven, his heart fills with joy.

10
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:12,580
Seeing his daughter live by his blessing,
he rejoices.
